    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Salvo e Valentino, sono due amici che rimasti disoccupati, abbandonano la grande citt\u00e0 per rifugiarsi nel piccolo paese d\u2019origine, Monteforte, dove la vita \u00e8 meno cara ed \u00e8 pi\u00f9 facile tirare avanti. L\u2019impatto con la nuova realt\u00e0 non risulter\u00e0 per nulla facile: i due si ritroveranno a vivere in un contesto diverso da quello che si erano immaginati: un paese pieno di anziani, da cui per\u00f2 \u00e8 impossibile non poter trarne beneficio. Ogni anziano rappresenta una pensione, un bel bottino per i due disoccupati\u2026",
        "english": "Salvo and Valentino are two friends who are out of work. They decide to leave the big city to make a new start in their small hometown, Monteforte, in Sicily, where the cost of living is lower and they can get by. Alas, the transition to this small-town dimension is anything but easy. The pair find themselves living in an environment very different from their imaginings: a town full of elderly residents, that is. And yet, making a profit off the oldsters is not inconceivable. After all, every old person represents a pension, which makes the jobless duo\u2019s mouths water..."
    },
